# Payment Portal Alpha — Cloud Build upload exclusions (skill UPLOAD_BOUNDARY.md baseline).
# This file governs what `gcloud builds submit` uploads. .dockerignore does NOT. Its presence disables
# automatic .gitignore mirroring, so .gitignore is included explicitly below.
# Verified with: gcloud meta list-files-for-upload .
.gcloudignore
.git
.git/**
#!include:.gitignore
node_modules/
.next/
**/.env*
.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*service*account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
.auth/
**/.auth/**
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
agent_docs/
_SKILLS/
# Playwright specs: not a build input (next build only needs src/ + config).
e2e/
# Added 2026-11-21 (alpha; carried over from the OwedBook alpha review, cyph-v1-dev 2026-11-20).
# Factory records that change around every deployment and are not build inputs. Keeping them
# out of the upload also keeps them out of deploy.sh's dirty-source check.
RECOVERY.md
CHANGELOG.md
DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md
# Case variants of credential file names (OwedBook canary test 2026-11-20: serviceAccount.json got through).
**/*[sS][eE][rR][vV][iI][cC][eE]*[aA][cC][cC][oO][uU][nN][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*[cC][rR][eE][dD][eE][nN][tT][iI][aA][lL][sS]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*.[pP][eE][mM]
**/*.[pP]12
**/*.[kK][eE][yY]
